ced virtual CPU (guest).\\n\\nThis object will not be implemented on hosts where\\nthe underlying operating system does not measure\\nthis particular CPU metric.\\n\\nOn a multi-processor system, the \'ssCpuRaw*\'\\ncounters are cumulative over all CPUs, so their\\nsum will typically be N*100 (for N processors).\",\"index\":[],\"name\":\"ucdTraps\",\"objectID\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021.251\",\"pid\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021\",\"status\":\"current\",\"subTree\":[{\"access\":\"read-only\",\"description\":\"The number of \'ticks\' (typically 1/100s) spent\\nby the CPU to run a niced virtual CPU (guest).\\n\\nThis object will not be implemented on hosts where\\nthe underlying operating system does not measure\\nthis particular CPU metric.\\n\\nOn a multi-processor system, the \'ssCpuRaw*\'\\ncounters are cumulative over all CPUs, so their\\nsum will typically be N*100 (for N processors).\",\"index\":[],\"name\":\"ucdStart\",\"objectID\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021.251.1\",\"pid\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021.251\",\"status\":\"current\",\"subTree\":[],\"syntax\":\"INTEGER\",\"type\":\"OBJECT\"},{\"access\":\"read-only\",\"description\":\"The number of \'ticks\' (typically 1/100s) spent\\nby the CPU to run a niced virtual CPU (guest).\\n\\nThis object will not be implemented on hosts where\\nthe underlying operating system does not measure\\nthis particular CPU metric.\\n\\nOn a multi-processor system, the \'ssCpuRaw*\'\\ncounters are cumulative over all CPUs, so their\\nsum will typically be N*100 (for N processors).\",\"index\":[],\"name\":\"ucdShutdown\",\"objectID\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021.251.2\",\"pid\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021.251\",\"status\":\"current\",\"subTree\":[],\"syntax\":\"INTEGER\",\"type\":\"OBJECT\"}],\"syntax\":\"INTEGER\",\"type\":\"IDENTIFIER\"},{\"access\":\"not-accessible\",\"description\":\"Table of monitored files.\",\"index\":[],\"name\":\"fileTable\",\"objectID\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021.15\",\"pid\":\"1.3.6.1.4.1.2021\",\"status\":\"current\",\"subTree\":[{\"access\":\"not-accessible\",\"